00:54:30.710 --> 00:54:32.630
Is jelly a condiment?

1129
00:54:33.090 --> 00:54:34.610
Is jelly a condiment?

1130
00:54:34.830 --> 00:54:37.550
I mean, you put it on, is butter a condiment?

1131
00:54:37.870 --> 00:54:38.790
