00:56:35.730 --> 00:56:36.610
It sounds like, you know what?

1179
00:56:36.730 --> 00:56:37.270
I'm sorry.

1180
00:56:37.450 --> 00:56:37.810
I'm sorry.

1181
00:56:37.810 --> 00:56:39.950
When you do that, it means you disagree.

1182
00:56:39.950 --> 00:56:40.770
Like, hmm.

